The system is divided into 5 main modules:
	1.	GUI Module (Tkinter)
	•	Handles user interaction
	•	Input fields, buttons, task display
	2.	Storage Module (CSV File)
	•	Stores tasks permanently
	•	Each task → name, description, deadline, email
	3.	Task Management Module
	•	Add, view, delete tasks
	•	Updates GUI + CSV file
	4.	Deadline Monitoring Module
	•	Uses datetime
	•	Checks if task is due in 24/48 hours
	5.	Notification Module
	•	Sends email using smtplib
	•	Alerts user about upcoming deadlines
	6.	Automation Module
	•	Runs periodic checks using after()
	•	Works in background automatically